  "readmeFile": "PACKAGE.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.6.0: ten new rules, for 36 in all, among them EFD031 (LINQ over a stored-procedure call), EFD032 (change to an AsNoTracking entity that is never saved), EFD033 (DbContext captured by a singleton), EFD034 (EnsureCreated with migrations), and EFD035 and EFD036, which read the model snapshot. The first code fixes ship in the analyzers package, for EFD002, EFD010, EFD019, and EFD029. EFD006 now honors a split-query default, and test-project detection no longer skips projects that only reference an assertion library. See CHANGELOG.md in the package.",
